From: hayaksi1 <193020925+hayaksi1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 12:09:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Repair four test source sets the merges leave broken

DefaultShareIntentHandlerTest carries its helper, the failing-grant
context, the zip provider and the companion twice, once from each of
two share branches. AndroidMediaPreProcessorTest declares the mimeType
parameter of its process helper twice for the same reason.
DefaultNotificationConversationServiceTest still calls onSendMessage in
two tests that arrived from other branches after
fix/1586-publish-conversation-shortcut renamed it to onMessageInRoom.

RustMatrixClientFactoryTest's "unavailable when the client secret is
missing" case describes the factory gating search on the secret; on
master that decision belongs to the client builder, which the sibling
test already covers, so the stale assertion goes.

Fork-Feature: fork-tooling
